    "title": "Linktree: Link in bio creator",
    "description": "Linktree is the original and most popular link in bio tool, used by over 30M creators monetizing and doing business around the world. Make your free Linktree link in bio in minutes, connecting followers and creators with everything you create in just one link in bio. Linktree helps creators to grow their followers, sell products, collect tips and more!\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s how it works:\r\n\r\n1. Create your Linktree link in bio URL for free (linktr.ee/[your bio])\r\n\r\n2. Add links, music, playlists, videos, podcasts, causes you care about, products, profiles, a store, your food menu\u2026 anything you want!\r\n\r\n3. Customize your design to match your brand and style with complete control of colors, fonts and button styles. Add a bio, and even upload custom background images and videos. You can also select from pre-made themes to get going even faster.\r\n\r\n4. Share your Linktree everywhere to connect followers with everything you do. Add your Linktree link in bio to your social profiles, email signature, resume and even get your QR code to use on menus, brochures, business cards and more.\r\n\r\n5. Learn what works to level up your Linktree on the go. Get insights and detailed analytics about your audience, what they click on, where they come from, and tons more.\r\n\r\nYour Linktree is waiting for you. Download the app today!",
